  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-datepicker (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-datepicker@1.0.0 is a combosquat placeholder impersonating the vl-ui design-system component namespace. The package ships no functional code: index.js contains only a comment, and there are no lifecycle hooks, scripts, binaries, or dependencies. It is a name-squatting package that reserves a plausible vl-ui component name (datepicker) under the trusted vl-ui naming convention, with no legitimate implementation.",
